WEBVTT

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:53.260
<i>No... this is meaningless.</i>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.270
<i>The Devil Z has been resurrected.</i>

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.630
You're driving like a complete psycho!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.560
It's too fast! Slow down!

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.340
You're so noisy... shut up.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.740
I shouldn't have agreed to take you.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.450
Eyes front, eyes front!

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.570
You're gonna hit it!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:32.930
Don't worry, I don't plan on dying in a car with you, boss.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:37.620
<i>Supra?</i>

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.940
<i>That's an odd tint of white...</i>

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.430
<i>It looks outstanding.</i>

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.140
<i>Brighter than silver.</i>

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.130
<i>The silver Supra.</i>

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:02.590
<i>Illusive Top Speed Racer</i>

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:08.240
OK, I'll handle it.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.490
I'll get it putting out massive horsepower at high revs.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.760
At high revs?

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.450
I see.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:22.250
The turbo will suck huge gulps of air
into the engine, to up the horsepower.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:27.370
Of course, there's a chance the car might
not be able to take that kind of acceleration.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.770
Talking like a doctor...

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:33.360
That's the interesting bit, isn't it?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.930
I never find it interesting.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.590
But speaking of speed,

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:44.520
I couldn't find a better car than this,
that's why I'm still driving it.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:52.240
I'll bet you're never worried about having an accident, huh?

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.260
On the contrary.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:02.860
The moment I leave the garage, I wonder if I'm ever coming back.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.890
Or whether I'll cause somebody else's death.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.270
Anyway, there's so much running on the road.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.560
Do you fear death?

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.380
Yeah, of course...

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.350
You won't die.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:25.980
Those who've never worried about it are all gone now.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.120
Your car is not just for fun.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:33.660
Whether it's a 100hp family car or even an 800hp monster.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.030
They're all murder weapons.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.120
When you understand that, you won't die.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.760
No matter how you run...

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.250
Hello, boss Yamamoto.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:01.530
As promised, I'm reporting for my fortnightly check-up, sir!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:05.670
Alright, I'm touched that you kept your promise.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:10.870
Of course. You'll always be the one to inspect my R personally.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.490
Because I'm the guy who tuned it.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.670
Take this R to elevator 3 and change the oil, please.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.170
Yes.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.000
This car is different from the normal ones.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.510
A total novice would simply add more power...

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.470
You hate tuning, right?

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.420
I heard you used to tune a lot of sports cars.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:36.910
That was the old days. Now, I don't
even really want to upgrade cars.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.580
Only your R is special, Reina-san.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.070
I reject anyone else.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.800
So, I'm special...

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.560
How can I thank you for that?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:49.630
Just your smile is good enough for an old guy like me.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.350
Look at that turbo.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:53.780
Huh?

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.030
It can't be...!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:57.950
No.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.670
It's one of my client's 3.6 liter turbo.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:04.550
It got into an accident at the loop line.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.900
Obviously thinking they were taking on the BlackBird.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.540
Someone challenged him from behind.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.830
Thankfully, it's nothing too bad.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.260
He's an old client of mine. He's careful most of the time...

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.530
He knows how to race properly...
He's not young anymore but

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:24.060
rather energetic and could win
pretty much any race if he wanted to.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.510
But now the tables have turned.

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:33.080
A normal 3.6 liter turbo can't compete at all.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.900
He couldn't just shake him off...

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:38.190
so he lost control on the straight.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:40.320
Was the other guy in an R?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.330
That's what I thought...

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:47.230
At that speed, only a 32 or a 33R could do it.

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.090
But I was wrong.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:55.300
It was this weird looking silver 80 Supra.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.810
The silver Supra?

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.360
<i>It's fast, but...</i>

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.360
The body?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.070
Yes.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:20.970
Even for a 911 which is really rigid, it's reached its limit.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:23.580
It just won't take any more power.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:27.580
The bodywork on all tuned cars gets loose after a while.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.590
You should have noticed it. You're losing power.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.530
Boss, there's someone here to see you.

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.800
He's looking for the guy in charge.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:45.100
For me?

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:48.450
He said Kitami-san told him to come and see you.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.490
Hey, nice car!

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.620
964.3 liter turbo.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.530
Bought from the official dealer.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.050
I'm in charge here, the name's Takagi.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.280
We have all of the latest computerized testing equipment.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.960
It's a pleasure, I'm Shima.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.730
So, what can I do for you?

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.210
The body looks superb.

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:16.050
Alignment...

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.990
About the wheel alignment?

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:21.020
Ok.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.100
We can check that out here, no problem.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.120
No, it's the body.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.060
And I'd like you to do this by yourself, boss.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.280
Please, if possible.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:37.730
I haven't done that kind of work for 10 years now.

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:41.040
You resurrected a Z not long ago.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:42.630
300km/h...

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.460
No, it's 320.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.490
It can take more speed than this,

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:51.460
hard as steel yet more flexible.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.880
I see...

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.040
And you would be the legendary BlackBird.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.250
Akio and that Z gave me the courage.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.090
That body will easily take 600hp.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.960
They told me I could still do it.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:17.070
But you... what can you give me?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.080
Let me tell you a fact.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.210
A fact?

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:25.380
Compared to the 240Z that gave you courage,

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.500
the fact is that you made it faster
than BlackBird, the Porsche Turbo.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:36.090
The BlackBird and Z are the ultimate rivals, aren't they?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.970
And Akio too....

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.530
So, are you gonna reject me?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.110
Found you!

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.610
Yeah.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:08.110
When I watch the traffic,

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.590
I always think that everyone's living
a normal life compared to us.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.340
Everyone else?

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.740
We are special, aren't we?

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.980
We love cars more than anything.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.510
We love racing...

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.090
Maybe.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.640
Akio-kun, are you only interested in cars?

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:31.350
You're the same, Reina!

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:32.670
I...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.370
<i>Driving wildly...</i>

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.580
<i>it's the only thing...</i>

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:46.350
<i>I can do.</i>

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:54.290
Hey Yamamoto-san, what can I do for you?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.610
It's about Aizawa.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:57.770
Aizawa?

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:04.920
It's the anniversary of his death soon.
Do you want to get all the guys together?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.610
Well...

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.470
I suppose we ought to.

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:12.440
Do you remember Aizawa had a little boy?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.700
I think so.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:17.400
He was about 3 or 4 years old.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:22.360
Well, I heard he's started driving too.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:26.450
Oh? The boy's grown up already?

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.670
That's fast.

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:30.420
Yeah, too right.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:36.120
So, does he look like his old man?

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:47.830
Only great service will win the customer over.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.390
Never forget that. Always work hard everyone.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:55.770
Lastly, I'd like to introduce a new employee to you all.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.120
Aizawa-kun, come forward.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.690
I'm Aizawa Keiichiro, nice to meet you.

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:06.190
So, what do we do?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:12.140
Ask his old man's friends to teach him how to drive?

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:16.700
Since when did you think like an old man too?

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:19.930
<i>Don't step on it if you don't wanna die.</i>

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.680
<i>That's what he used to say.</i>

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:23.710
I remember.

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:26.730
Well, you can do whatever you want.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.950
I'm busy with other things.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.900
<i>When people remember it's been 15 years,</i>

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.940
<i>there'll be someone who remembers
it's been only 15 years.</i>

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:43.820
<i>I've never forgotten about it for one day.</i>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.490
<i>And I never will forget...</i>

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:52.500
<i>the illusive top speed racer.</i>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.570
Yeah, it's Takagi.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.010
Yes, I accept.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.510
I'd like to know the condition of the body.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.190
<i>Can you bring it over tonight, Shima-san?</i>

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.520
Yes, I can. This evening it is then.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:16.060
Yeah.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.520
You just do whatever you think is good.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.990
I understand. Leave it to me then.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.370
Akio, over here.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.310
Takagi-san.

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.850
How are you? Feeling better now?

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:39.030
Yeah, sort of.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:43.040
Anyway Akio, I'd like you to drive a car for me.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:44.520
Me?

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.550
That one.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:59.230
You've raced it but never driven it before, right?

00:13:59.230 --> 00:13:59.760
Yeah.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.720
The owner agreed.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.780
So, can you take it to the loop line?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.790
What is it? Just step on the gas.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:28.640
Ladies club? Why do you work there again?

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.720
Because they pay well.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.370
It's never enough no matter how much I earn.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.680
Spent it on the car?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.730
Yeah, something like that.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.820
I think my dad used to work in a ladies club too.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.010
Maybe it's in my genes.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.820
But, as a host you need to...

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:54.700
Yes? Oh, it's you Takashi.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:58.910
BlackBird is on the loop line?

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.010
<i>No doubt, it's that turbo!</i>

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:02.720
<i>Not, it's running a second round!</i>

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.490
Ok, I got it! I'm on my way.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.210
Leaving already, Kei?

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.720
Yeah. I finally get to see it.

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:20.090
Takagi-san, this car...

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.980
Have you noticed?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.950
Yes... you're starting to drive this car.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.980
You're now driving it like you do when you race that Z.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:32.400
The BlackBird...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.700
This is really...

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:40.410
Can you feel it losing power?

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:42.800
You'll get used to it.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.090
The more skill you have, the faster you can go.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:47.630
This is a monster.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.470
The body is working loose and can't take the power.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.420
It gives and illusion of power.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:58.050
It makes people think it's going fast.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:01.180
Takagi-san. Can I take it on Wangan?

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:04.960
Welcome!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.470
Coffee, please.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.900
Did you see BlackBird?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.910
Yeah. I think Kei has gone too.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:14.300
He's really serious.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.410
It's a tough one, even for Kei...

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:19.580
Is BlackBird really that amazing?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.910
Oh yeah, he's like a legend.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:26.440
The fastest black turbo on Wangan.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.890
Hard to compete with it.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.920
He's in a different league!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.150
Why make him the target?

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:35.480
He really wants to be the best in the city.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.450
The loop line, Wangan, Yokohane...

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:45.180
To beat BlackBird, Devil Z and everyone else out there.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:49.690
He owes a lot of money, just running that car.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.950
Hey, is Kei's new car fast?

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.250
It is.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.940
It's an 80 Supra Twin Turbo.

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:59.410
Very fast.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:03.120
Generally, with a boost of 1.2 it has around 500hp.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.660
If you boost to 1.8, you're looking north of 700hp.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.250
It's just like a monster.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.920
Isn't it dangerous to drive?

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.010
Of course it is!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.960
An FR car with 700hp.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:20.040
Damn. It's not suitable for racing on the loop line.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:29.600
You wouldn't catch me risking it like that anymore. But Kei...

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:36.940
So, why doesn't Kei use a GT-R?

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:39.410
They're easier to drive.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:45.120
They are easier, but Kei's father
who died in a crash wasn't in a GT-R.

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.580
Eh? Kei's father died in a car crash?

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.080
Yeah. 15 years ago, by a drunk driver.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.790
I heard he was doing less than 50km/h.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:58.840
What car was it? Didn't you three used to hang out?

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:03.340
Yeah. Koda and Maki were in the same
kindergarten as Kei, right?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:06.610
I can't remember what car it was.

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:08.850
We were just 3 or 4 years old then.

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:10.360
But...

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.190
I know it was a very fast car.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:17.690
<i>Reaching that speed...</i>

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.100
<i>in this car.</i>

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.240
<i>The rear wheels spin if I push harder.</i>

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.610
<i>If I slow down, the front-end stiffens up.</i>

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.620
<i>And the power is not getting to the road.</i>

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.050
Bingo.

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:36.080
With the traffic on the loop line,
I knew you'd take line 9 to Wangan.

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:46.060
Do you know that Supra?

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:47.520
He's after us.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.810
I don't know who it is, I've never seen it.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.840
But he looks like and old friend of mine.

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.320
Get rid of him.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:02.280
I will not let you escape, BlackBird.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.740
Takagi-san, he's catching up really quickly.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:13.430
That Supra is fast.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.240
Are you sure he looks like your friend?

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.900
Yes. In fact I'm pretty surprised.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.900
But the age is a long way off.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:40.480
Age?

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.340
He should be at least 40 plus by now.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.280
If... he was still alive.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.930
<i>There was a boy...</i>

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.790
<i>around 3 or 4 years old.</i>

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.040
<i>If it was 15 years later... it could be him.</i>

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:58.500
<i>Although I don't think it's a coincidence.</i>

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:04.470
<i>Maybe his boy is old enough to drive that Supra now.</i>

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.290
<i>Please strengthen the body for me.</i>

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:12.090
<i>I asked Kitami-san to tune my engine.</i>

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:15.270
<i>He said I must ask Takagi-san to do the body.</i>

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.480
<i>Really? Kitami-san...?</i>

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.540
<i>It's ok if it gets very hard.</i>

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.980
<i>As long as it can withstand 300 km/h.</i>

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:26.070
<i>300? Is it for racing?</i>

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.230
No, for highways...

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.320
<i>I want to drive 300km/h on the highways.</i>

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:36.260
<i>It's a 2.8XX.</i>

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:38.130
<i>A car with twin turbo.</i>

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:42.690
<i>There's no data. No one knows how to tune it.</i>

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:45.730
<i>300 km/h on the highways...</i>

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:47.620
<i>That speed is beyond reality.</i>

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.720
<i>That was 15 years ago...</i>

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.220
<i>He really wanted to achieve the dream.</i>

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:56.690
Get to the front, Akio.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.720
Don't stay with him just for me.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.650
You don't have to let him win.

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:05.620
Once you start it, just keep looking forward.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:09.150
No matter when, you only step on the gas for yourself.

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.790
<i>Was that acceleration for real?</i>

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:26.180
<i>Was he holding back the whole time?</i>

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.730
<i>U-turn at the Ooi junction.</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.720
<i>There's a chance if we get to the loop line.</i>

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:10.980
<i>No one knows this S route better than me.</i>

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.020
<i>No one's faster than the Supra here!</i>

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:19.020
He makes the wild car go straight.

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:20.160
Great skill.

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:20.680
Yeah.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.690
<i>Just like... Aizawa-san.</i>

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:44.650
<i>I don't believe it.</i>

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.260
<i>He can still take me.</i>

00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:51.510
<i>He's pulling away...</i>

00:22:52.030 --> 00:22:54.020
<i>At C1... I'll never get him off the loop line.</i>

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:05.870
<i>You've definitely got skill!</i>

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>But you better watch out...</i>

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:15.190
<i>We'll see who's the winner next time we meet.</i>
